    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Norse warrior with a plaited copper beard and moustache, iron nasal helm, layered fur pauldrons, studded leather cuirass with a round bronze brooch, green embroidered under-tunic, wrapped bracers, fur-cuffed trousers and laced boots. Back views confirm a round shield with a raised dragon relief and a bearded axe slung across it; the fur, stud rows and tunic hem continue correctly around the body. Top and bottom views are closed. Rigged: 54-bone humanoid armature (24 body + 30 finger bones), walk and run clips, zero unweighted skinned vertices.",
    "limitations": [
      "AI-assisted origin is disclosed upstream (origin.ai_content); some storefronts require an AI-content disclosure when you resell.",
      "The axe and shield are fused to the body mesh and cannot be detached or swapped.",
      "Fur is modelled shell geometry, not groomed hair or a simulation."
    ],
